Emails: also the erased customer's email may appear in `operations.notifications.destination` etc. Collect union of: customers.email, contacts.value where kind='email', notification_preferences.destination, email_deliveries.destination (for this customer), refunds.customer_email (for this customer's payments). Good coverage for Mailpit deletion.

